Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did say under the\Nchin, right, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember me, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Anubistan you fought earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, what do I do now? Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna shave your jaw clean off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.09,0:00:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what have you done with the barber?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.15,0:00:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, could it possibly be that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword is actually the stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be controlling the barber?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the guy at Khan Ombo wasn't\Na real stand user? Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.99,0:01:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.17,0:01:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still way out of your league, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you must know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.57,0:01:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of learning\Nchariots' moves during our last fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose twice to the same adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.48,0:01:30.32,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to wake up with the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The death of the land of the darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.11,0:02:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,END OF THE WORLD
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:03:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's it you can do it yeah come on you\Ncan't give up now you've almost got it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.95,0:03:03.41,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(466,570)\pos(151,850)}Episode 29: Anubis, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,polnareff and jotaro they\Nshould have returned by now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polareff, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Barber's a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.37,0:03:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword is the stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's too dangerous to try using Star\NPlatinum's bare fist against this blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword's sharp enough\Nto slice through them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Barber isn't the stand\Nuser, he's just a puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not even the worst part!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.59,0:03:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand's even stronger\Nthan it was before!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:03:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too much for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.77,0:04:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should be grateful you've\Nshown me the limits of your defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's see if you have what\Nit takes to survive my next attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we, Polnareff? Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His powers keep increasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With every strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't keep parrying forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later he's gonna get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't realized the\Nobvious, I know all your moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who my wielder is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as I've done battle\Nwith you at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:04:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna win this without my rapier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, help me out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think that finished him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That punch was shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it took just\Nabout everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while now since\Nwe've seen a stand like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only relies on strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rumors of your speed were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now that I've seen it,\NI can easily defeat it.
