Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend is being controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to get sliced to\Nribbons, go back inside and hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in major trouble, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.53,0:06:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more we fight this\Nstand, the faster it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.37,0:06:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And its next attack will probably\Nbe its fastest and strongest yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to be ready for whatever this\Nglorified butter knife throws at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.61,0:06:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one it's really after!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there, Jotaro! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.89,0:06:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his bare hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For him to take that great of a risk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's become abundantly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:07:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The true source of Star Platinum's\Nstrength isn't its speed or precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Jotaro's nerves of steel and\Nability to make quick decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, now I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.53,0:07:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just knocked out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't touch that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You snapped it in half, but the stand's\Npowers might still be lingering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It controls anyone who\Ntouches it while unsheathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.05,0:07:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get the blade back inside\Nwithout touching the hilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.15,0:07:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone draws it again, we're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This damn thing has already\Nlearned all of our abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think we're gonna\Nget any second chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not toss it into the river to\Nrust at the bottom of the Nile?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Nile, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a great plan to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.65,0:08:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy needs a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have multiple reports of\Na brawl at a barber shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand this weapon over immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.49,0:08:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.47,0:08:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't unsheathe it!
