Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff is being controlled\Nby the sword's spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drew the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I drew the sword, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.15,0:08:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officer, you should really be more\Ncareful with your accusations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since you call yourself\Na servant of the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm simply attacking the culprit\Nwho uncheateth the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are\Nor where you're hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.43,0:09:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think it's safe to say\NPolnareff is under your control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I've never had\Nto fight against Polnareff before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't pull punches\Nwith Chariot as an opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not smart about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could end up killing Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I said before,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at this point I've already witnessed Star\NPlatinum's entire repertoire of moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I've done battle with you once\Nbefore, then I will never lose again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His speed…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.09,0:10:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.49,0:10:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting fast enough to outpace me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.27,0:10:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to stop that sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sped up! This time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This speed and power are overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.27,0:10:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt, this is the\Nfastest stand I've ever faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the rate I'm going,\Nthis won't end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to fight Polnareff with\Neverything I've got, or I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you headbutted the sword after you\Nrealized you couldn't catch my blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:11:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I didn't think you were capable\Nof something like that. I almost had you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I've acquired that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,skill as well Jotaro I can tell
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you're thinking The only\Nway to survive is to kill
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend Polnareff. Even if\Nyou wanted to, it's naive to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think it'd be that easy take\Na close look Jotaro what am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.65,0:11:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about to show you will put an\Nend to this once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's see if you can beat this, Totoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on the\NSilver Chariot and Anubis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two-Sword Technique!
