Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.61,0:12:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This extra sword, coupled\Nwith this accelerating speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even Star Platinum won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling a little tired, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stop him before he kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My right arm is as light as a feather now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.13,0:12:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.05,0:12:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that was an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't see that coming, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Round two, armor release!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ridiculous aura is no match for two\Nswords wielded by two Master Swordmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stomach is wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got you now!
