Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.32,0:13:27.36,SFXOang,3,0,0,0,,{=19}{\bord8.72\fscx141.7\fscy109\fade(255,0,255,-620,-620,-230,40)\frz11.27\pos(1312.03,478.31)}Stab!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.25,0:13:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Teo, I've exterminated Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.23,0:13:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Anubis, have finally put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.35,0:13:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to be able\Nto pull out that blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure your tiny brain has realized\Nit, but I've surpassed Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, the final thrust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final thrust?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I slice open your bowels,\NMaster Dio will rejoice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't drive the blade any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.07,0:14:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but you won't\Nget any mercy from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to spill your guts!
