Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you it'd be murder, but the murder\NI was talking about was yours, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a pretty easy target when\Nthe sword isn't moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was the toughest opponent I've faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, the attack took everything\NI had in me and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was just enough to\Ndefeat him before he could
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,learn it like he did\Nthe rest of our attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been so exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find Avdol and the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.43,0:15:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword didn't possess me like\Nit did all the other guys, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:16:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get the old man and Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.39,0:16:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too tired to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so shiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I've learned that trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My original stand user was the\Nswordsmith who forged me 500 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may have perished centuries ago, but\NI survive as a stand with no master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Tio liberated me from the\Ngloomy shadows of a dusty museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speaking of Master Tio, his stand,\Nthe world, is far more powerful than I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.85,0:16:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I pledged my undying loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.15,0:17:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, I swear on my\Nlife, I will murder you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know your strength, your speed.
