Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't see it coming until\Nit's too late to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stab you in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a... I missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was tripped by a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did that mutt come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.51,0:17:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iggy, what are you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a nasty old sucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.43,0:17:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eating right off the ground\Nagain, you filthy mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Nile River!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I do to deserve this cruel fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I fall into the river,\NI'm done for. I'll rust away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.81,0:17:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading for a wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wall will stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.87,0:18:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.13,0:18:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so panicked about\Nfalling into the water
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.51,0:18:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I accidentally face\Nright through the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.27,0:18:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I wedge into those planks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's curiosity will\Nmake him pull me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I'll take over his pathetic mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.01,0:18:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I'm safely back on dry land!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use his body to\Ntake revenge on Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cow's on board Stop thrashing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.57,0:18:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you call it, you stupid cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take over the cow's mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.23,0:18:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it'll be a cinch...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go to make it inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.87,0:18:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cow's really rocking\Nthe boat, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.65,0:19:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who gives a damn?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go get the old man an Avdol, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.61,0:19:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Oh, fishies! Look down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swim over to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind doing me a\Nfavor and taking me ashore?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you something yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crab, you just can't leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be rusting through\Nin a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.76,0:20:03.80,Anubis Retires,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(-20,819.2)}Anubis
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.80,0:20:03.84,Anubis Retires,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(245,819.2)}Anubis
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.84,0:20:06.72,Anubis Retires,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(326.4,819.2)}Anubis
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.59,0:20:06.72,Anubis Retires,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(771.6,819.2)}Retired
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.87,0:20:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to eat\Nover there, fleabag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you stinkin' little...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.69,0:20:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell have you been eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Polareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.41,0:20:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think, all of that happened without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.61,0:20:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fought the Anubis stan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.43,0:20:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have been rough, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the last time I\Never go anywhere with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.19,0:20:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it already, you stupid mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.97,0:20:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell off my face!
