Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The average tourist to Egypt is mostly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.49,0:21:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unaware of the country's\Nrich ethnic diversity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, take this Egyptian man\Nwearing the traditional Jalabia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.93,0:21:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or this Egyptian Nubian.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here is a Bedouin from\NEgypt's desert region.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gentleman hails from India.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as a random example, here's\Nanother Egyptian citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that fox has got some smoking\Nhot legs that are out of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't keep my eyes off her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, those puppies will\Npull you right in, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.11,0:22:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.53,0:22:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.95,0:23:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.87,0:23:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.09,0:23:30.09,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.39,0:23:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.31,0:23:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think\Nyou're doing, you old pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.67,0:23:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong here!
